   "population": "Pinhole arithmetic for a 4032x3024 (4:3, 12 MP) image; 35 mm equivalence defined on the image diagonal (43.27 mm), as in face3d.geometry.camera.focal_px_from_35mm",
   "source_urls": [],
   "status": "knowledge",
   "notes": "Derived, not empirical. f_px = f35 * hypot(W,H) / 43.2666. If a vendor defines EXIF FocalLengthIn35mmFilm on width instead of diagonal, values shift by ~4% for 4:3."
  },
